<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord I believe,</l><l>When all around me is defeat</l><l>And it seems that nothing’s changing outwardly.</l><l>No! I’m not discouraged,</l><l>I’m believing You.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Yes, I believe,</l><l>And there is no demand on me.</l><l>Simple faith, yes, that is all You want from me.</l><l>Freed from anxious doubting—</l><l>I’m free to just believe!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Believing You,</l><l>Because, Lord, You are my success!</l><l>When I fail, all I must do is just confess,</l><l>And go on enjoying You—</l><l>I love believing You!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
